sentences.l:
To him answering spoke the glorious son:
“O father, truly my heart, even afterward, I think,
you will come to know;

but him, as it turned out, meanwhile led away homeward a power,
and let us here for him plan grievous destruction,
for Telemachus, and may he not escape us;

let us not then, in plenty, to the heart’s pleasing, devour his goods,
gathering here, but from the hall each one
let him woo, seeking with bridal gifts;
